Z||000002||MinnGreenGT||10-04-2001||09:40 AM||||Eagle1 or ArmorAll wheel cleaner... and toothbrush.  Yeah, I know I rack my knuckes a few time whenever I do a good cleaning on the wheels (really needs it right now).<P>------------------<BR>           <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/GreenGT6.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000003||Fformula88||10-04-2001||10:21 AM||||I picked up a cleaning "tool" which actually makes the job a lot easier... Its a woolley type material in a cone shape with a handle on the back.  I just stick it into every spoke, give it a twist and pull it out, dipping it in clear water every few spokes.  Works really good!  But I still have to wax them a couple times a year and thats torturous! ||||reg||1
